  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Consultancy for development of new round of Strategic Partnerships (SPA3)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this assignment is to support MFA in the development of the new round of Strategic Partnerships starting from 2026. The assignment includes consultations with MFA and stakeholders, revision and development of application process and documents as well as development of supporting formats of the new framework. The assignment is expected to run from August 2024 to February 2025.</narrative>
  </description>
